# Every proof

The root of the library `Proofs`: the proofs about the protocol model and the model as an instance
of the record (`lean/Proofs/Vocabulary/`), the claims (`lean/Proofs/Claims/`), and the spec's
instance of the record `Model.specDraft` with its facts (`lean/Proofs/Instance/`). The end results
at that instance are the library `EndResults` (`lean/EndResults.lean` and `lean/EndResults/`).
-/
